                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I didn't like this game when I first tried it.  Seemed a bit confusing. A long time later seeing I only had 1 achievement I want to try and get more, so gave it another shot.  I focused a bit more on understanding how they oil drillers worked. I eventually got the hand of it. Now I want to get to the end. I'd not now say its a great game, but it has its fun. It won't be one I'll go back to when I've had this fussy out of it. If you like real action and bright lights its not for you. But if you like strategy and learning how something works then this could be worth a shot.",
